https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adonispuente","id":60629070,"login":"adonispuente","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNjI5MDcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-development-proxy/commits/45ae67f8a6cb5726fb35335c830f026a20dddb24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T19:16:01Z","email":"adonis.puente@gmail.com","name":"Adonis Puente"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T14:31:04Z","email":"adonis.puente@gmail.com","name":"Adonis Puente"},"message":"feat: add Location header rewriting for local proxy retention\n\nRewrites Location headers in IOP mode to keep users on the local proxy URL.\n\nWhen IOP instances send redirects (e.g., for login), they include absolute\nLocation headers pointing to the IOP instance. This change rewrites them\nto point to the local proxy, ensuring local assets continue loading.\n\nExample:\n  Before: Location: https://ip-10-0-167-79.../users/login\n  After:  Location: https://iop.foo.redhat.com:1337/users/login\n\nTested with IOP instance running Foreman 3.16.","tree":{"sha":"33f10cdc6b80a3193b37a17b1b11af2803a6790a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-development-proxy/git/trees/33f10cdc6b80a3193b37a17b1b11af2803a6790a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/frontend-development-proxy/git/commits/45ae67f8a6cb5726fb35335c830f026a20dddb24","verification":{"payload":"tree 33f10cdc6b80a3193b37a17b1b11af2803a6790a\nparent 142c47bf41ae000a2092b9a5b5a8678447a9b4a1\nauthor Adonis Puente <adonis.puente@gmail.com> 1782328561 -0500\ncommitter Adonis Puente <adonis.puente@gmail.com> 1784039464 -0500\n\nfeat: add Location header rewriting for local proxy retention\n\nRewrites Location headers in IOP mode to keep users on the local proxy URL.\n\nWhen IOP instances send redirects (e.g., for login), they include absolute\nLocation headers pointing to the IOP instance. This change rewrites them\nto point to the local proxy, ensuring local assets continue loading.\n\nExample:\n  Before: Location: https://ip-10-0-167-79.../users/login\n  After:  Location: https://iop.foo.redhat.com:1337/users/login\n\nTested with IOP instance running Foreman 3.16.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qGugEv++GIODcUzyqyMhVIWWI\nS2fXCZ5c1F9kKgtooAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHXxuu0c5fD7yyaE+ZgSEpY/YyanGQWD5D4m2zLKt47pc9TcYGRdFZN34rv9xYc34f\nKX4uygCmx4qDAFJs8tbgU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-14T14:32:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60629070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adonispuente","id":60629070,"login":"adonispuente","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNjI5MDcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuente/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adonispuent