/r-brown/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/r-brown","id":1361258,"login":"r-brown","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjEyNTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Labs64/labs64.io-customer-portal/commits/632b98b4d7859871864b6ff1b97877b048036e76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:26:21Z","email":"alexey.averikhin@labs64.de","name":"Alexey Averikhin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:26:21Z","email":"alexey.averikhin@labs64.de","name":"Alexey Averikhin"},"message":"What changed\n#\tSuggestion\tOutcome\n1\tRelease internals properly\tNo pom carries a version any more: all declare ${revision} (default 0.0.0-SNAPSHOT), and a GitHub Release tag X.Y.Z becomes the jar version, image tag and label. A tagged build is refused if its parent or any dependency is a snapshot.\n2\tShared parent POM\tNew io.labs64:labs64io-parent in commons holds the Spring Boot line, BOM overrides, shared versions and the commons library versions. Commons is now one reactor; the three services inherit the parent.\n3\tHelmfile as only owner\tThe helm-charts justfile no longer holds chart versions, repo lists or value layering. install-tool <name>, install-app, template, diff and the uninstall recipes all go through the helmfile.\n4\tRenovate\tShared preset default.json in the workspace; every repo''s renovate.json only extends it. Dependabot configs are removed. Pins outside manifests carry a # renovate: annotation.\n5\tClose the chain\tThe chart-update PR now also bumps the umbrella. Renovate tracks CHART_VERSION in devops against your chart repo. install.sh resolves the recorded or latest published version.\n6\tOne tool-versions file\ttool-versions.env feeds the devcontainer, just doctor and CI through a setup-k8s-tools action.\n7\tDocs and defects\tGuardrail 6 rewritten, ArgoCD claims removed, GPG debug step gone, duplicate Maven release workflows folded into maven-publish.yml, callers reference @v1.\nTwo new gates run under just check: the existing release-wiring check, and check-pins, which replaces the \"keep in lockstep\" comments (ESO, Keycloak, Gateway API, Cerbos, OTel, tool versions, no literal pom versions).","tree":{"sha":"3560f01bdd27b06ea6cc1e66682f7c8976125480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Labs64/labs64.io-customer-portal/git/trees/3560f01bdd27b06ea6cc1e66682f7c8976125480"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Labs64/labs64.io-customer-portal/git/commits/632b98b4d7859871864b6ff1b97877b048036e76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1361258?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/r-brown","id":1361258,"login":"r-brown","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjEyNTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/r-brown","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https