0\n41.84/66.75 ms -> 1.39/14.97 ms reflects rejection, not faster valid pages.\nSeparate traces capture 475 EF commands for 45 accepted requests and none\nfor 45 rejected requests. The order handler bodies remain unchanged.\n\nVerification: qualified red 17/21 -> 21/21 green, combined focused 85/85;\nfull backend 8,443 unit + 845 integration + 434 host tests pass, no skips.\nActual Swagger differs in exactly nine maximum values. Supported generation\npreserves all three TypeScript clients, 453 Swift and 429 Kotlin files byte\nfor byte. Docs build and nine applicable repo checkers pass; baseline legal\ngate qualification is retained. Record commands and measured tradeoffs in\nthe Wave A report; final cap-head CI and owner merge review remain pending.","tree":{"sha":"2a0c8f3473770b427a69706e7f34d7710763af2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/2a0c8f3473770b427a69706e7f34d7710763af2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/9028d9827625de30d9aa37a9187072028a2a5eea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions