il.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"fix: end customer Live Activities on iOS session teardown\n\nRegister the coordinator first in the existing cache registry, invalidate the session before suspension, cancel observers and immediately end captured tracked plus actual OS activities. Guard resumed adoption and token/state callbacks by session generation so old work cannot repopulate or remove a new session''s activity. Failed deletion keeps the session.\n\nPrimary and iOS 16.4 cleanup/race cases pass 6/6 after demonstrated lifecycle and race failures. Fifteen cleanup cards end, five failed-deletion controls preserve cards, and delayed callbacks leave the new session''s card active. Simulator responsive-launch median/p90 0.885/0.907→0.932/0.941 s; no native speed gain or APNs/physical-device claim is made.","tree":{"sha":"480c13b644a29b84c22c48c3819e86b89e4351c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/480c13b644a29b84c22c48c3819e86b89e4351c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/b0d7f51926b003414436c253df6fe0208eab4dca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github