:"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T23:41:11Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"fix: preserve customer JSON responses through SSR hydration\n\nGenerate customer JSON operations as text through supported NSwag templates and parse existing typed DTOs without FileReader. Keep binary Blob responses and parse text error bodies through the existing interceptor. Update three obsolete Blob fixtures to the actual JSON transport while preserving their business assertions.\n\nFive real SSR/offline captures per arm change from empty catalogue bodies and FileReader failures to transferred nonempty market, service, package, currency and plan data. The focused transport set passes 46/46; composite web verification passes 4911 tests across 71 projects. Lighthouse median/p90 LCP 5278.59/5296.24→5202.66/5210.95 ms remains above budget; no causal speed or bundle-size gain is claimed.","tree":{"sha":"cb73a0cde25712ffb2457f499547b4d480ccf4a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/cb73a0cde25712ffb2457f499547b4d480ccf4a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/9c2e97f23bff2221e3bfa100332760bd0f9b7d51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/9c2e97f23bff2221e3bfa100332760bd0f9b7d51","node_id":"C_kwDOPNcZQNoAKDljMmU5N2YyM2JmZjIyMjFlM2JmYTEwMDMzMjc2MGJkMGY5YjdkNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/de230a78f0a509820f328496efc30369a97187c8","sha":"de230a78f0a509820f328496efc30369a97187c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/de230a78f0a509820f328496efc30369a97187c8"}],"sha":"9c2e97f23bff2221e3bfa100332760bd0f9b7d51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/9c2e97f23bff2221e3bfa100332760bd0f9b7d51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/de230a78f0a509820f328496efc30369a97187c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T23:41:10Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T23:41:10Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"fix: order pages deterministically and select page IDs once\n\nDefault to CreatedOn descending then Id descending, preserve explicit direction and currency-leading financial sorts, and normalize recognized Id keys across cultures. Select Admin/Partner page IDs once before split projection, reapply the full visibility/tenant filter, then restore the selected ordinal before the existing pay stage.\n\nThe focused regression set passes 72/72 after demonstrated failures. Full backend tests pass 8430 unit, 845 integration and 434 host cases. Both timing arms complete 5500 HTTP 200 observations: board median/p95 286.99/304.92→613.98/630.50 ms, Admin 23.97/27.87→42.24/47.51 ms. This correctness change retains a measured latency cost; no API speed gain is claimed. Separate traces show Admin 6→7 and board 15→16 SQL commands, with one scalar selector and five bounded projections instead of five repeated global selectors.","tree":{"sha":"c471a67865aaad694af51a26a6fe0dd9d1595a32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/c471a67865aaad694af51a26a6fe0dd9d1595a32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/de230a78f0a509820f328496efc30369a97187c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://