fb15db5aa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/25e116901cd8a986e7d1ee0a13c039fb15db5aa5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/5e3af49d77d640b01f251e8f594591c6c466a770/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T16:23:29Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T16:23:29Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"docs(owner-decisions): a retried refund asks Stripe for the refund on its key first and a Stripe-failed one is closed and raised at once, a fee cancellation of a partly refunded order returns what the sale holds less the fee and the crew is paid on no more than the fee, the wind-down reaches partly refunded bookings, the write-off closes the pay link first, the override opens the door debt, the archive waits for open receivables, a door default never blocks a referral, and Mapbox degrades on a Polly rejection\n\nWritten after the 2026-10-06 owner-decision lanes landed green (2f1649062, 486ce965f, 3ea902a69, f1ff90099, bda774b43, a3117a62c, 6a17164d2, 29e8d237b, 5a00d1036, e4ae9db2a, 0622a47ec, c4c313cd0, 71a71cf59). Removes the known-gap, open-finding and owner-ruling bullets these items closed, and records the accepted risk that a pay link Stripe no longer knows blocks its receivable''s write-off and so the archive, cleared by a data fix of PayLinkSessionId.\n\nDeliberate additions beyond business-rules, the three flow pages, ADR-0064 and admin order management: the admin-notifier, platform-order-cancellation, company-lifecycle, company-settlement-reader and company-archive role cards, the execution flow''s override row, the referralCredit lines in the markets API page and the domain model, and the outbound-resilience section of the infrastructure page, each of which stated the behaviour these fixes changed.","tree":{"sha":"1d5faf7dbc0ddef351af0da6ed5542f87a60add0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/1d5faf7dbc0ddef351af0da6ed5542f87a60add0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/5e3af49d77d640b01f251e8f594591c6c466a770","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https:/