 receipt, order.cash_not_paid shows on iOS, and owing stops creating or changing a schedule\n\nWritten after the round-3 lanes landed green (5e7d93c61, c717850c4, 520baa4c1, 66931db7a, 391d5d846, 9e3f797c1, 3904250d5, 45e872263, 3274dec39, 42af91e09). Also corrects the business-register sentence on the Employee concurrency tokens: one conflict ends the day-ahead digest run and fails every later cleaner in a new-jobs sweep, accepted under CLAUDE.md section 4.\n\nDeliberate additions beyond business-rules and the two flow pages: the admin order-management and partner order-management pages, the admin-notifier, fcm-message-factory, platform-order-cancellation and company-settlement-reader role cards, ADR-0064 (what-shipped row and D3 predicate), and the Stripe__Enabled kill-switch row, each of which stated the behaviour these fixes changed.","tree":{"sha":"acc5e203b84b9d26706bd08350eb8a8615ec2f55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/acc5e203b84b9d26706bd08350eb8a8615ec2f55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/e98a050dd0c5cad933774a8a61b259679c65a94b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starr