"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/3904250d5f2124a06928429a86180a3b6d5262e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T02:24:01Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T02:24:01Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"fix(settlement): a door price paid online or written off no longer counts its order as awaiting a sale receipt, so the company can still be archived\n\nAn order the cleaner reported unpaid completes with its price owed and never gets a sale receipt. Once the UnpaidCash debt was Paid or WrittenOff, OrdersAwaitingReceipt still counted it for good and ArchiveCompany refused the company with company.has_orders_awaiting_receipt, with no action that could clear it. A cash order now counts only while its door debt is open or once cash recorded later made it Paid.","tree":{"sha":"632148e46471889bb2f04a9775d3b7d4df0b72bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/632148e46471889bb2f04a9775d3b7d4df0b72bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/3904250d5f2124a06928429a86180a3b6d5262e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/priva