cs(manual-steps): the owed DEV drop for 20261005201452 also seeds the 2026-10-07 terms, and this branch reaches production no earlier than the day they take effect","tree":{"sha":"818a96b466fa60fe088220d7ec3a043160da0d2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/818a96b466fa60fe088220d7ec3a043160da0d2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/0fd0a10a2fbc50c4b13aa03377587d0547fe3aff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/0fd0a10a2fbc50c4b13aa03377587d0547fe3aff","node_id":"C_kwDOPNcZQNoAKDBmZDBhMTBhMmZiYzUwYzRiMTNhYTAzMzc3NTg3ZDA1NDdmZTNhZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/1852063ac36fee799d6cd218815731cb5b744201","sha":"1852063ac36fee799d6cd218815731cb5b744201","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/1852063ac36fee799d6cd218815731cb5b744201"}],"sha":"0fd0a10a2fbc50c4b13aa03377587d0547fe3aff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/0fd0a10a2fbc50c4b13aa03377587d0547fe3aff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/1852063ac36fee799d6cd218815731cb5b744201/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:44:12Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:44:12Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"docs: an amount owed refuses every booking and a door non-payment is owed; pending card refunds count against every ceiling, a partly refunded order cancelled free gets the rest, and the whole price back reads Refunded; query values, Sentry request detail and stacked retries are gone\n\nOwner rulings 2026-10-06 (B1-B3), written after the lanes landed green: the booking ban at every way in and its client answers, the cleaner''s door report and the admin cash recording that closes it, the cap of two counted as upcoming bookings, the 2026-10-07 terms, and ADR-0070 amended (18 (a) reversed to 18 (b), D8 lifted for unpaid cash). The refund seam counting pending rows and keeping a retry''s amount, the guest claim raised after a day, the fee-free cancellation of a partly refunded order and the two-arm Refunded rule (M2, M3, X2, X3, T3). The approval and save race refused at commit (T1), an unreadable ARES reply logged once at Error (T2), the request line masking every query value and Sentry keeping no query string and four headers (L1, X1), and one resilience pipeline per client with ADR-0005 amended for SendGrid''s keyless retry (L2).","tree":{"sha":"fa3f69fb6a2e2afad30605ffc7ebc15957f88894","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/fa3f69fb6a2e2afad30605ffc7ebc15957f88894"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/1852063ac36fee799d6cd218815731cb5b744201","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","t