3:06:59Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"feat(admin-web): the administrators feed reads the door-report alert admin.order.cash_not_paid and opens its order, and Record cash received says it also closes what a customer reported unpaid owes [B3]\n\nThe page mirror of the backend catalogue carries the sixteenth key, with a title and a body naming the order and the amount in five locales. The record-cash panel context adds that recording the cash closes the open debt and is refused once the customer paid it online, pinned per locale. The receivables page already labels UnpaidCash.","tree":{"sha":"270475cd6436525a804ca9be9d846fde5ee79088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/270475cd6436525a804ca9be9d846fde5ee79088"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/baab7f667a70f8eaba7cbe18ebd919fa8b1f6af0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_t