feat(customer-web): a booking, a repeat schedule or a visit confirmation refused while the customer owes any company an amount lists everything owed with Pay now, by card as well as cash; order.cash_unpaid_receivable is retired for order.unpaid_receivable and the cap of two cash bookings names the upcoming ones [B2, B1]\n\nOwner ruling 2026-10-06. The wizard keeps the chosen way to pay and returns to the payment step with the list and the parked draft; the schedule form and the order page show the same list, the order page all of it rather than this order only. The amount-due intro no longer says card bookings are unaffected, and a spec pins that no booking or amount-due string in five locales says card stays open while owing. Parity roster moved to the new key.\n\nDeliberate addition: the recurring prefill contract (RecurringPrefillParams, RECURRING_PREFILL_STORAGE_KEY) moves from the recurring-bookings lib to @cleansia/customer-services, unchanged, so the schedule form can render the orders lib amount-due list without a circular project dependency (orders already imported recurring-bookings for it).","tree":{"sha":"02cbf34c62421a3f39c4f7ffe1e2a27db4bf6480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/02cbf34c62421a3f39c4f7ffe1e2a27db4bf6480"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/9d569595f7e2e8953dac24cb2348a2d8a7e92cef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node