/api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/3edc565b34a68b181b469c2002c58ef9a88d3397/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:06:28Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:06:28Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"feat(partner-web): the cleaner reports from the job sheet that the customer did not pay cash at the door, after a confirmation that says the order completes, the customer owes the price and cannot book, an administrator is alerted and the reward is paid [B3]\n\nA \"Customer did not pay\" action on a cash order in progress still awaiting payment, for a cleaner on its crew, beside \"Mark cash collected\". It asks first through the shared confirmation, then calls the regenerated POST api/Order/ReportCashNotPaid and says what the customer owes in the server figure. A refusal is left to the translated interceptor toast and re-reads the job; a seat without its contract acceptance opens the contract dialog. Without an after photo the page warns as Complete does. Copy in five locales.","tree":{"sha":"22d2bbd945fb094f390ba4229422d9e79371c249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/22d2bbd945fb094f390ba4229422d9e79371c249"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/3edc565b34a68b181b469c2002c58ef9a88d3397","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_ur