pi.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/223db7c6a4878e0f0b0a588350e62f6837a8ff2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:04:52Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:04:52Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"feat(ios-customer): a customer who owes an amount is refused every booking with a way to pay it, is told when a door price goes unpaid, and reads the cash cap as upcoming bookings [B1, B2, B3]\n\nOwner ruling 2026-10-06, at parity with the customer Android app. order.unpaid_receivable replaces the retired order.cash_unpaid_receivable in the Core catalog in five locales. When the server refuses a booking for it, cash or card, the booking sheet, the schedule form (create and edit) and the recurring confirm open a system alert with Pay now, which goes to Payments over the profile; any other refusal still snackbars. The key is found among every key the 400 body carries: ApiError now keeps them all, split where whole-booking rules share one wire code and arrive \"; \"-joined. The order.cash_not_paid push copy (customer bundle) and its tap, which opens Payments, are in place; the key stays out of the feed keyset until the server lists it, so it bumps no badge for a row the feed would not return. The cap-of-2 refusal now says it counts upcoming cash bookings not yet paid, and the Payments intro no longer says card bookings are unaffected.\n\nUpdateRecurringInput''s convenience init moved, unchanged, from CreateRecurringViewModel.swift to RecurringModels.swift beside its type, to keep the view model file under the SwiftLint file-length ceiling.","tree":{"sha":"feb7fc8eee540a2ef56b2742129a67b418b561f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/feb7fc8eee540a2ef56b2742129a67b418b561f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/223db7c6a4878e0f0b0a588350e62f6837a8ff2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/223db7c6a4878e0f0b0a588350e62f6837a8ff2e","node_id":"C_kwDOPNcZQNoAKDIyM2RiN2M2YTQ4NzhlMGYwYjBhNTg4MzUwZTYyZjY4MzdhOGZmMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/d3aa991bcf770597c282f80cd7af39df72f07a0b","sha":"d3aa991bcf770597c282f80cd7af39df72f07a0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/d3aa991bcf770597c282f80cd7af39df72f07a0b"}],"sha":"223db7c6a4878e0f0b0a588350e62f6837a8ff2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/223db7c6a4878e0f0b0a588350e62f6837a8ff2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/d3aa991bcf770597c282f80cd7af39df72f07a0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:04:11Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T23:04:29Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"feat(ios-partner): the cleaner on a cash job reports a customer who paid nothing at the door, behind a confirm that names what the customer will owe [B3]\n\nOwner ruling 2026-10-06, at parity with the partner Android app. On an in-progress cash job of theirs whose payment is still pending, once the after photos are in, the cleaner sees \"Customer did not pay\" beneath \"Mark cash collected\". The tap opens a system confirm that says to use it only when nothing was paid, that the job completes and the cleaner is paid, and that the customer will owe the price less any credit applied and cannot book until it is paid. Confirming calls POST api/Order/ReportCashNotPaid from the committed partner mobile spec (the generated client is rebuilt by CI); the job leaves the active list for the history, the order refetches and a toast confirms. Every refusal the endpoint can answer already resolves to a sentence in five locales; the partner error roster now names it.\n\nThe partner bundle also carries the customer push copy push.order.cash_not_paid in five locales: the server registers an APNs event only once both iOS bundles do, and the customer bundle gets it in the next commit.","tree":{"sha":"1dee533354fca8fe0b52e6d64d235a9bb3b9127a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/1dee533354fca8fe0b52e6d64d235a9bb3b9127a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/d3aa991bcf770597c282f80cd7af39df72f07a0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"html_