received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/8365129a6cbc01df29b22b6b4ff2c523ef869011/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:10:48Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:10:48Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"feat(orders): the cleaner reports a customer who did not pay cash at the door; the job completes and the price becomes a debt with a pay link [B3]\n\nOwner ruling 2026-10-06. POST api/Order/ReportCashNotPaid on the Partner and Partner Mobile hosts, for the assigned cleaner of a signed-in customer cash booking in progress, under the completion gates. It completes the job with the payment still pending, opens an UnpaidCash receivable for the price less any credit applied, pays the cleaner the full reward of a completed job, issues no receipt and grants no loyalty points or referral credit. The customer gets a push (order.cash_not_paid, data-only until the apps render it) and an e-mail in five languages pointing to the order page where the pay link is minted; administrators get admin.order.cash_not_paid. Recording cash received closes the open debt in the same commit and is refused once it was paid online. The pay-link e-mail no longer promises that card stays open (B2). Partner web client regenerated and the partner mobile spec re-dumped.","tree":{"sha":"48dd8ff2cf3d65fa39874a154aee4f7ce73f3ce1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/48dd8ff2cf3d65fa39874a154aee4f7ce73f3ce1"},"