","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/4613974f72936de6a1b37165bb7fffcf9418f175/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:10:22Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:10:22Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"feat(booking): a customer who owes any company money makes no new booking, cash or card, until it is paid or written off [B2]\n\nOwner ruling 2026-10-06. The one-off booking (web and mobile), both recurring schedule writes and the confirmation of an occurrence refuse a signed-in customer with an open receivable in any company with order.unpaid_receivable, which replaces order.cash_unpaid_receivable; the confirmation refuses before the consent is recorded and before Stripe is asked. The recurring sweep creates no visit for an owner who owes and keeps the schedule. A guest is not matched by e-mail. Bookings already made are kept, and the cap of two cash bookings not yet paid at the door is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"428755fca83c804756b48aa8f6c0ed8d0ddbef8b","url":"https://api.githu