ithub.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/c0897edc7fb68f44f197100f3068c48fa236d289/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:11:28Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:11:28Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"fix(refunds): a guest''s refund claim left pending on a booking that went ahead is raised to the administrators after a day for a check in Stripe, never re-driven [X2]\n\nThe claim may be one Stripe paid before a timeout, and every later refund on the order now counts it as owed, so ignoring it silently held back money with nobody told why. It raises the existing refund_needs_retry alert once per order; the hourly job still never re-drives it.","tree":{"sha":"2d25843c9111ab756c1196daf895e3ee3a8f5fbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/2d25843c9111ab756c1196daf895e3ee3a8f5fbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/c0897edc7fb68f44f197100f3068c48fa236d289","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id"