mments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/14be6aededee96a0164c9149fee7089cb4a60255/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:49:07Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:49:07Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"docs: the standalone-icon fix counts only icons a page draws [Z-11]\n\n9a2753975 and d9b42bb3e counted an icon that no page draws. The\ninformation dialog''s icon (.cleansia-dialog__icon--info) has had no\ntemplate since the customer site''s card-capture dialogs were removed on\n2026-10-04 (3ded20c61), before b35d7f8d7 recoloured it. Its 2.51:1 was\nthe computed sky-500 on its wash, not anything on screen.\n\n- architecture/frontend.md (#link-ink): the bullet now says nine drawn\n  icons and drops the dialog icon from the list. One clause says the\n  dialog''s --info modifier took the same sky-600 although nothing draws\n  it. The ratio ranges stand: 2.01-2.60 before, 3.49-4.10 after.\n- CHANGELOG.md, the cleaner Fixed entry: the website draws eight such\n  icons, not ten. Ten counted the dead dialog icon and the admin-only\n  pay settings banner icon, which the admin entry already covers. The\n  admin entry is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"e3bc737269473a89f225ebeb7a283b837ef788ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/e3bc737269473a89f225ebeb7a283b837ef788ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/14be6aededee96a0164c9149fee7089cb4a60255","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_