e it showed;\n  - the four tertiary roles, light and dark, in a table with their\n    ratios;\n  - the three tertiaryContainer notices, which now read amber as on iOS;\n  - the status sites that now name their colour: pendingInk for a pending\n    document and the outside-the-area note, onSurfaceVariant for the\n    registration lock''s pending row, as iOS''s step row draws them;\n  - SurfaceRolesTest.\n  Two open gaps are recorded as reported, not changed. iOS''s own\n  outside-the-area note is still amber-500, about 2:1. The customer\n  scheme still leaves tertiary unset, and iOS''s customer\n  tertiaryContainer copies its mauve.","tree":{"sha":"c84106454f88f2a4f45800793ddc3935851e9daf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/c84106454f88f2a4f45800793ddc3935851e9daf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/182f4d5bcdee0c7e72e645b45109fb87e88e436a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Micha