l Chaban"},"message":"docs: a partner document''s status reads 4.5:1 in both apps [Z-3]\n\nDocuments eba022747 (iOS) and the documents half of 0ae302746 (Android).\nIn the iOS partner app, a document''s Pending read 2.15:1 in light mode\nand its Approved 2.92:1 in dark. On Android, Pending was Material''s mauve\ntertiary.\n\n- mobile-app/patterns.md (#brand-text-ink): a paragraph after the payment\n  pill. Both apps'' Pending now takes pendingInk. iOS''s Approved takes\n  successInk. Android''s Approved stays the text ink, so the two apps''\n  hues still differ: that difference predates this wave and is recorded,\n  not changed. It links to the tertiary roles and names the test and the\n  commits.","tree":{"sha":"2eafae566d45b0902a7f809814253c3703c1ce30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/2eafae566d45b0902a7f809814253c3703c1ce30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/3bc880b1666e17e39df63e351ff1a841156be251","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/sub