:"2026-10-05T19:34:48Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"docs: a partner order''s payment pill reads 4.5:1 in both apps [Z-2]\n\nDocuments eb083ee4f (iOS) and 11a7a5c99 (Android). patterns.md has a\nparagraph for each status pill that was raised to 4.5:1: the dispute pill,\nthe order pill and the invoice pill. The partner payment pill, which this\nfinding named, had none.\n\n- mobile-app/patterns.md (#brand-text-ink): a paragraph after the order and\n  invoice pills. It gives the failing ratios on each platform before the\n  fix, and a light/dark ink per status in a table, the same pairs as the\n  dispute pill. The wash still follows the ink. It names the pairs\n  (iOS CleansiaColors.pendingInk / successInk, Android''s partner\n  pendingInk) and the two tests that measure every severity.","tree":{"sha":"c73ca078e37de6ebfe2c651ad6e7fcf4386305f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/c73ca078e37de6ebfe2c651ad6e7fcf4386305f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/b7f918f0af135ab2cc65b4f53cf864b409a5008b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://ap