n/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/fb535333ca695a87569665fbb1e5909237993ff8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:33:11Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:33:11Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"docs: the gate table lists the two newest gates, two records note offerability-parity.yml never existed, and the checker count is 18 [Z-13]\n\nWhat was wrong: agents/process/enforcement.md''s \"What''s mechanical today\"\ntable had no row for the two newest CI gates, although its own banner\nlists both as blocking. ADR-0042 and the generated-client contract notes\nsay offerability-parity.yml \"gates\" check-available-status-parity.mjs and\ncite its lines; that workflow is not in the repository, and git log --all\nfinds no commit that ever contained it. CLAUDE.md said \"17 repo checkers,\neight with their own self-test\"; HEAD has 18 check-*.mjs and 9 .test.mjs.\n\nWhat changed:\n- enforcement.md: rows for check-ios-symbols.mjs (ios-symbols-ci.yml) and\n  check-booking-policy-parity.mjs (booking-policy-parity.yml), what each\n  covers, and that each self-test blocks first.\n- docs/decisions/adr-0042.md and\n  agents/architecture/decisions/generated-client-contract.md: a dated\n  correction at the top. The bodies are not rewritten. The note names\n  where the shape they cite does exist (ios-symbols-ci.yml,\n  booking-policy-parity.yml) and points at enforcement.md for the gates.\n  Deliberate addition: the same sentences cite nx-project-registration.yml\n  as the second instance of that shape. It is equally absent from every\n  commit, so the note covers it too instead of leaving half the sentence\n  wrong.\n- CLAUDE.md: 18 repo checkers, nine with their own self-test. The owner\n  approved this edit for the count only.","tree":{"sha":"332120238cf97f70141bff46af4306d09ba23f09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/332120238cf97f70141bff46af4306d09ba23f09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/fb535333ca695a87569665fbb1e5909237993ff8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/fb535333ca695a87569665fbb1e5909237993ff8","node_id":"C_kwDOPNcZQNoAKGZiNTM1MzMzY2E2OTVhODc1Njk2NjVmYmIxZTU5MDkyMzc5OTNmZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/d96084bc6d32c3873b9c84ef91b8805ea7d6b87c","sha":"d96084bc6d32c3873b9c84ef91b8805ea7d6b87c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/d96084bc6d32c3873b9c84ef91b8805ea7d6b87c"}],"sha":"fb535333ca695a87569665fbb1e5909237993ff8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/fb535333ca695a87569665fbb1e5909237993ff8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/d96084bc6d32c3873b9c84ef91b8805ea7d6b87c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:18:29Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:18:29Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"fix(web): shared styles read the primary PrimeNG 20 declares, not --primary-color [Z-12]\n\nPrimeNG 20 names its primary --p-primary-color. Eleven shared declarations\nstill read the old --primary-color, which nothing declares, so each one\nsilently lost its colour (measured in Chromium on the running apps):\n\n  - the code boxes'' focused and filled borders, and the address\n    suggestion''s icon, fell back to Tailwind''s #3b82f6;\n  - the file drop area''s border under the pointer, focused and with a file\n    dragged over it, and a picked file''s icon, went to the text colour\n    (black, white after dark): the declaration is invalid at computed time,\n    which also cancelled the customer site''s own accent border under the\n    pointer. The focus ring read --primary-color-alpha-20, also undeclared,\n    so the whole box-shadow dropped to none;\n  - the partner order photos'' count and upload line inherited their\n    parent''s black.\n\nBorders and icons take the PrimeNG primary, --p-primary-color: Sky600 on\nthe light theme (4.10 on white), Sky400 after dark on the customer site\n(6.83 to 8.07), which is what the customer site''s own field focus already\nuses. Blue text takes the text ink, Sky700 (5.93). The file area''s focus\nring and the code boxes'' focus ring use rgba(--cleansia-primary-rgb); the\ncode boxes'' ring was Tailwind''s rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15) beside the border\nit surrounds, and moves with it as a deliberate addition.\n\n.time-comparison-item--actual takes Sky700 as well; no template draws it\ntoday (the complete-order dialog renders a detail grid). The order chart''s\n.service-item__revenue rule, which no template draws either, is deleted.","tree":{"sha":"fd1abf811593e9316716dbbf538dd81e29892bdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/fd1abf811593e9316716dbbf538dd81e29892bdb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/d96084bc6d32c3873b9c84ef91b8805ea7d6b87c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/d96084bc6d32c3873b9c84ef91b8805ea7d6b87c","node_id":"C_kwDOPNcZQNoAKGQ5NjA4NGJjNmQzMmMzODczYjljODRlZjkxYjg4MDVlYTdkNmI4N2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/b35d7f8d79f20f272b3f3e286339c20dce57f029","sha":"b35d7f8d79f20f272b3f3e286339c20dce57f029","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/b35d7f8d79f20f272b3f3e286339c20dce57f029"}],"sha":"d96084bc6d32c3873b9c84ef91b8805ea7d6b87c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/d96084bc6d32c3873b9c84ef91b8805ea7d6b87c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/b35d7f8d79f20f272b3f3e286339c20dce57f029/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:15:58Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:15:58Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"fix(web): standalone icons on the partner and admin sites take the brand blue [Z-11]\n\nTen standalone icons on the partner and admin sites were drawn in the\nlighter blues, under the 3:1 an icon needs against its ground (measured in\nChromium on the running partner app; the admin banner on its compiled\nstylesheet):\n\n  Sky500: the help card''s dismiss X (2.36 on its header tint), the info\n  dialog icon (2.51), the order activity''s note icon (2.60), the admin\n  pay-config banner''s info icon (2.60);\n  Sky400: the help card''s step arrow (2.01), the empty-section icon (2.01),\n  the not-found icon (2.01), the document dropzone icon (2.14), the invoice\n  banner''s meta icons (2.14), the order header''s meta icons (2.14).\n\nEach takes the brand blue, Sky600 (--cleansia-primary-600), as standalone\nicons do (owner ruling 2026-10-05: fills, borders and standalone icons keep\nthe brand blue). Measured after: 3.49 to 4.10. The dismiss X keeps its Sky700\nunder the pointer; the dialog''s dark-theme info icon keeps its own Sky400.\n\nThe dialog stylesheet''s $primary variable (Sky500) had the info icon as its\nonly reader and is removed with it. In the spec, the compile and inks\nhelpers move to module scope so the new icon block can share them.","tree":{"sha":"cffe5b22afa5f561a38f58cde5740d4fd531d1c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/cffe5b22afa5f561a38f58cde5740d4fd531d1c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/b35d7f8d79f20f272b3f3e286339c20dce57f029","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/b35d7f8d79f20f272b3f3e286339c20dce57f029","node_id":"C_kwDOPNcZQNoAKGIzNWQ3ZjhkNzlmMjBmMjcyYjNmM2UyODYzMzljMjBkY2U1N2YwMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/460213f7f28fa240ff7a84cb7791d8f5e136f494","sha":"460213f7f28fa240ff7a84cb7791d8f5e136f494","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/460213f7f28fa240ff7a84cb7791d8f5e136f494"}],"sha":"b35d7f8d79f20f272b3f3e286339c20dce57f029","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/b35d7f8d79f20f272b3f3e286339c20dce57f029"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/460213f7f28fa240ff7a84cb7791d8f5e136f494/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:14:23Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:14:23Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"fix(web-customer): the cookie notice''s OK reads after dark [Z-10]\n\nAfter dark the customer site''s cookie notice painted its OK button with its\nown gradient, Sky400 to Sky500, under the white label: 2.14 at the light end\nand 2.77 at the other, 2.77 to 4.10 under the pointer (measured in Chromium\non the running customer app). The light theme was already white on Sky600\nto Sky700 and is left as it is.\n\nAfter dark the button keeps its white label, as every filled button on the\ncustomer site does after dark, on a gradient one step deeper than the light\ntheme''s: Sky700 to Sky800 at rest, Sky800 to Sky900 under the pointer.\nMeasured after: 5.93 / 7.56 at rest, 7.56 / 9.46 under the pointer.","tree":{"sha":"5499cbb15550c20cc31e239425af3746400797ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/5499cbb15550c20cc31e239425af3746400797ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/460213f7f28fa240ff7a84cb7791d8f5e136f494","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/460213f7f28fa240ff7a84cb7791d8f5e136f494","node_id":"C_kwDOPNcZQNoAKDQ2MDIxM2Y3ZjI4ZmEyNDBmZjdhODRjYjc3OTFkOGY1ZTEzNmY0OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/66f6d3a6d681c59cb25372337786de57f51dffa1","sha":"66f6d3a6d681c59cb25372337786de57f51dffa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/66f6d3a6d681c59cb25372337786de57f51dffa1"}],"sha":"460213f7f28fa240ff7a84cb7791d8f5e136f494","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/460213f7f28fa240ff7a84cb7791d8f5e136f494"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/66f6d3a6d681c59cb25372337786de57f51dffa1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:13:05Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:13:05Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"fix(web-partner): the dashboard''s green success figures read at 4.5 [Z-9]\n\nThe partner dashboard draws its good-news figures in green: the order\nchart''s completion rate and a positive earnings growth, both a\n`<cleansia-label color=\"success\">`. The label''s success ink was emerald-500\n#10b981: 2.08 on the order summary''s blue wash (#dbeafe) and 2.43 on the\nearnings summary (#f9fafb), measured in Chromium on the running partner app.\n\nIt takes green-800 (--cleansia-success-800): 5.84 on the wash, 6.82 on the\nearnings summary. Green-700 would be 4.11 on the wash.\n\nThe two chart modifiers the finding named beside it,\n.summary-item__value--success and .summary-item__value--positive, carried\nthe same green and take the same token. No template uses either, and a\nlater .summary-item__value rule of equal weight overrides them, so they\nchange nothing on screen today.","tree":{"sha":"50d844275162703ae662bf7fe1335849509a6466","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/50d844275162703ae662bf7fe1335849509a6466"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/66f6d3a6d681c59cb25372337786de57f51dffa1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/66f6d3a6d681c59cb25372337786de57f51dffa1","node_id":"C_kwDOPNcZQNoAKDY2ZjZkM2E2ZDY4MWM1OWNiMjUzNzIzMzc3ODZkZTU3ZjUxZGZmYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/18ffe5ecf6ca6852b5bfe3f43787ab39d15077f2","sha":"18ffe5ecf6ca6852b5bfe3f43787ab39d15077f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/18ffe5ecf6ca6852b5bfe3f43787ab39d15077f2"}],"sha":"66f6d3a6d681c59cb25372337786de57f51dffa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/66f6d3a6d681c59cb25372337786de57f51dffa1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/18ffe5ecf6ca6852b5bfe3f43787ab39d15077f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:12:33Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:12:33Z","email":"cmisa695@gmail.com","name":"Michael Chaban"},"message":"fix(ios): a filled button''s label reads 4.5:1 in dark mode, on sky-950 [Z-7]\n\nWhat was wrong: CleansiaColors.onPrimary is sky-900 in dark mode, which reads 4.42:1 on the dark primary,\nsky-400: every CleansiaPrimaryButton''s label and spinner, the prominent slide-to-confirm''s label, the\nsubtle one''s thumb glyph, and the screens that pass onPrimary on a primary fill themselves (selected\nchips and day pills, the FAB glyph, badges and avatar camera discs).\n\nWhat changed: dark-mode onPrimary is sky-950, 6.48:1 on sky-400. Light mode keeps white on the brand\nblue, as the owner kept it for filled buttons. Every onPrimary site sits on the primary or on the brand\ngradient, all lighter than sky-950, so none reads lower. Android''s dark onPrimary takes the same sky-950\n(its lane, same wave).\n\nTest: ComponentTextInkTests measures dark onPrimary on the dark primary (6.48:1), pins light mode to\nwhite, and pins the filled button to the onPrimary-on-primary pair.","tree":{"sha":"0b067982408a4f157d0d316357ed1eeab9e56778","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/trees/0b067982408a4f157d0d316357ed1eeab9e56778"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/git/commits/18ffe5ecf6ca6852b5bfe3f43787ab39d15077f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76599514?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelChaban","id":76599514,"login":"MichaelChaban","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTk5NTE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MichaelChaban","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/18ffe5ecf6ca6852b5bfe3f43787ab39d15077f2","node_id":"C_kwDOPNcZQNoAKDE4ZmZlNWVjZjZjYTY4NTJiNWJmZTNmNDM3ODdhYjM5ZDE1MDc3ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commit/7524479e084d7ec17b0db3ee60f213d8c28cd107","sha":"7524479e084d7ec17b0db3ee60f213d8c28cd107","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/7524479e084d7ec17b0db3ee60f213d8c28cd107"}],"sha":"18ffe5ecf6ca6852b5bfe3f43787ab39d15077f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits/18ffe5ecf6ca6852b5bfe3f43787ab39d15077f2"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/VM-s-Solutions/cleansia/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=6fa0492badf9ab5c9f30fee3beb680f7fcc1f265&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A44%3A21.213Z"}');
